      "value": "I actually asked tupper about this very thing when i first met him and he said its currently not possible because of how most mapmakers make culling in their worlds work\n\nif they were to implement teleporting, the culling wouldnt work when you teleport and you would just fall out of the world because the collision hasnt loaded for you in the area you teleported to",
